  "description": "Free in-process DevTools for Avalonia 12: visual/logical tree inspector, ❄ hold-the-moment freeze for popups/flyouts/tooltips/hover styling, live property editing with typed editors and color picker, layout box model, style/value-frame viewer with go-to-source and pinnable pseudo-classes, exploded 3D view, a unified timeline (routed events, property changes, view-model notifies) with binding inspection and cause links, copy-as-bug-report capture, log viewer, renderer overlays and an IDE-style dark UI. Attach with this.AttachAvaDevTools() and press F12.",
